h('Request and data flow')
add('The browser calls relative /api URLs with credentials included. In development, Vite on port 3000 proxies traffic to Express on port 4000. Express creates/propagates x-request-id, logs duration/status, enforces request policy, parses cookies and bounded bodies, and dispatches routers. Prisma accesses PostgreSQL. Most successful responses use a data envelope; errors use an error object.')
h('Deployment shape')
add('Express serves an existing dist/ directory with an SPA fallback. Docker builds UI and backend in a builder stage and runs Node as an unprivileged user. This is a modular monolith; no separate microservices, queue, Redis cache or background worker was found.')
note('Documentation corrections: navigation uses pushState/popstate, not React Router; the API client uses fetch, not Axios. Helmet is neither listed nor mounted. The @google/genai dependency does not establish an implemented AI workflow.')
source('src/App.tsx; src/services/apiClient.ts; vite.config.ts; server/app.ts; Dockerfile')
