h('Roles and seller lifecycle')
add('Database roles are CUSTOMER, ADMIN and SUPER_ADMIN; UI values are customer, admin and superadmin. SellerStatus is separate: PENDING, APPROVED, REJECTED or SUSPENDED. Approval promotes the linked user to ADMIN. Suspension archives products matched by specifications.sellerId or specifications.sellerEmail.')
h('What the metrics represent')
add('Merchant paid revenue sums that merchant\'s item totals from paid orders; it is not net settlement revenue and does not allocate order-level tax, shipping or discounts. Low stock means stock <=10 for unarchived products. The analytics tab contains fixed monthly revenue bars and a fixed +24% YoY label. Present these as sample UI data, not measured business results.')
note('Seller scope is incomplete: order status/payment mutations check admin role without a merchant-ownership condition; matching order lists include every order item. Suspension is not checked by requireAuth/requireAdmin. These are release-priority findings, not verified protections.')
